text.section:
It is unlawful for any person:

To use the Virginia Quality Label or a label with the shield of the United States in violation of any provisions of this article;


To use, with the intent to mislead or deceive, any imitation or counterfeit likeness of the Virginia Quality Label, or a label or shield of the United States: (i) on the label, tag, seal, container, or sign of any product that is sold or offered for sale; or (ii) in connection with any offer to sell or advertise for sale any product.
